Racer 3DS - Nintendo 3DS build target for sp00nznet/racer
==========================================================

This repository vendors complete, already-integrated source trees. There are
no patch files to apply and no downloads performed at build time. Each vendored
component keeps its original license file in its own directory; the summary
below is an index, not a substitute for those licenses.

Top-level components
--------------------

platform/3ds/                         New code written for this target (MIT).
                                      The 3DS GameDesc, host functions, CMake
                                      packaging glue and HOME Menu icon.

lib/rt64-3ds/                         RT64-equivalent PICA200 renderer and 3DS
                                      platform runtime (MIT, see
                                      lib/rt64-3ds/LICENSE). Includes the CMake
                                      packaging modules, RSF template and shader
                                      build rules used by this target.

lib/N64ModernRuntime/                 N64ModernRuntime fork with the resolved
                                      3DS changes vendored directly in its
                                      sources (GNU GPL v3, see
                                      lib/N64ModernRuntime/COPYING). Its
                                      librecomp/ and ultramodern/ subtrees
                                      provide the recompilation runtime, and
                                      thirdparty/ holds the components listed
                                      below.

lib/N64ModernRuntime/N64Recomp/       N64Recomp recompiler toolchain and
                                      RSPRecomp, used as host tools (MIT, see
                                      lib/N64ModernRuntime/N64Recomp/LICENSE).

Vendored third-party components (each with its license in place)
-----------------------------------------------------------------

lib/N64ModernRuntime/thirdparty/:
  concurrentqueue, json, miniz, o1heap, sse2neon, xxHash
lib/N64ModernRuntime/N64Recomp/lib/:
  ELFIO, fmt, rabbitizer, tomlplusplus
lib/rt64-3ds/third_party/:
  GamepadMotionHelpers

ROM-derived data
----------------

No ROM-derived data is committed or redistributed: no recompiled game
functions, no RSP microcode output, no textures and no audio. The ROM itself is
never copied into the repository. Running tools/3ds/recompile.sh generates
such data locally under platform/3ds/generated/ (gitignored) from the user's
own legally-owned ROM, and a locally built Racer3DS.cia therefore contains
code derived from that ROM. It must not be redistributed without the rights to
do so.

At runtime the game expects the user's ROM at
sdmc:/3ds/racer/baserom.z64 and validates it with an XXH3 hash
(0x9B89D0F9EBC12D32) before starting.

